+Full sweep of every tracked file family in the repository: all 3 GitHub workflows, both Python programs, all 4 docs, README, ECOSYSTEM_MAP, AGENTS.md + AGENT_RULES.md, both issue templates, the complete `infrastructure/mcp-control-plane/` tree (~150 files), `api-schemas/`, `examples/`, plus live verification through `gh`, local reproduction, and the canonical validator.
